<title>UK: Credit Local sets 400 mln Dkr bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 400 mln Dkr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    06.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YIELD	5.62	SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
